# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 2. Start: late_i21_k1.keys' end save (Ephraim's route, final chapter part 1, turn 1, Ephraim has waited, suspended). Resume Chapter, the map menu on grey Ephraim, End: the enemy phase (no battles; over by about tick 2,600 on the PC), turn 2's player phase (suspend saves).
# 4000 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu (opens on Resume Chapter)
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter: the slot list
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, resume
000*148
001*2      # 1850: A on grey Ephraim: the map menu
000*98
040*2      # 1950: Up, wraps to End
000*98
001*2      # 2050: A, End: the enemy phase
000*1948
